  destinations:
  - destinationName: Pine Trail
    description: 'Towering pine trees create cool shaded paths deep inside the forest.

      Fresh
      mountain air fills every breath as birds sing overhead.

      Hidden treasures
      lie beyond every bend in the trail.

      Adventure quietly awaits those willing
      to explore.'
    background: {fileID: -2416170729605204148, guid: 431370ece61614a3d965836aea49752e, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Mushroom Grove
    description: 'Colorful mushrooms blanket the forest floor beneath ancient trees.

      Tiny
      woodland creatures peek from hidden corners as you journey onward.

      Every
      puzzle uncovers another magical part of this enchanted grove.

      Nature''s
      secrets are waiting to be discovered.'
    background: {fileID: -2793232688286180050, guid: 8acb19f9cb2d1422bbdbbaf17e91e054, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Hidden Pond
    description: 'A crystal-clear pond rests quietly among dense forest trees.

      Gentle
      ripples reflect the sky while wildlife gathers along the shore.

      Search
      nearby paths to uncover hidden wonders and peaceful scenery.

      Every visit
      offers a moment of calm before the next adventure.'
    background: {fileID: 2964778737234396788, guid: 9627d37f9a922433f928d2849f7c0e5d, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Ancient Oak
    description: 'An enormous oak tree has watched over these woods for countless
      generations.

      Its twisting roots hide forgotten pathways and mysterious
      discoveries.

      Explore beneath its mighty branches to uncover ancient
      secrets.

      Every challenge brings you closer to the forest''s timeless
      story.'
    background: {fileID: -5567485127816286670, guid: d5b87f79a3e4d4870b885dd52c356eaf, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Firefly Forest
    description: 'As daylight fades, thousands of glowing fireflies illuminate the
      forest.

      Soft golden lights dance through the trees creating a magical
      atmosphere.

      Each puzzle lights the way toward another hidden discovery.

      Night
      has never felt so full of wonder.'
    background: {fileID: -497878556614250900, guid: 64b9f17d86a9649bd9f213d3e208b776, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Fern Valley
    description: 'Lush green ferns cover every corner of this peaceful valley.

      Gentle
      streams wind through the landscape surrounded by vibrant nature.

      Hidden
      trails invite curious explorers to venture even deeper.

      Every step reveals
      another beautiful surprise.'
    background: {fileID: -3962425006660122120, guid: a973ee30a680c4fe79ce0b294cdbc98c, type: 3}
